---
id: mutation-property-order
title: Ensure correct order of inference-sensitive properties in useMutation()
---
NIFT_TANSTACK_DOCUMENT_V1
{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For the following functions, the property order of the passed in object matters due to type inference:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useMutation()"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The correct property order is as follows:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onMutate"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onError"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSettled"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All other properties are insensitive to the order as they do not depend on type inference."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"rule-details","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rule Details"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples of "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"incorrect"}]},{"type":"text","value":" code for this rule:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/mutation-property-order\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useMutation } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nconst mutation = useMutation({\n  mutationFn: () => Promise.resolve('success'),\n  onSettled: () => {\n    results.push('onSettled-promise')\n    return Promise.resolve('also-ignored') // Promise<string> (should be ignored)\n  },\n  onMutate: async () => {\n    results.push('onMutate-async')\n    await sleep(1)\n    return { backup: 'async-data' }\n  },\n  onError: async () => {\n    results.push('onError-async-start')\n    await sleep(1)\n    results.push('onError-async-end')\n  },\n})","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples of "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"correct"}]},{"type":"text","value":" code for this rule:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/mutation-property-order\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useMutation } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nconst mutation = useMutation({\n  mutationFn: () => Promise.resolve('success'),\n  onMutate: async () => {\n    results.push('onMutate-async')\n    await sleep(1)\n    return { backup: 'async-data' }\n  },\n  onError: async () => {\n    results.push('onError-async-start')\n    await sleep(1)\n    results.push('onError-async-end')\n  },\n  onSettled: () => {\n    results.push('onSettled-promise')\n    return Promise.resolve('also-ignored') // Promise<string> (should be ignored)\n  },\n})","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"attributes","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Attributes"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅ Recommended"}]}],"checked":true},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔧 Fixable"}]}],"checked":true}]}],"headings":[{"id":"rule-details","text":"Rule Details","level":2},{"id":"attributes","text":"Attributes","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nFor the following functions, the property order of the passed in object matters due to type inference:\n\n- `useMutation()`\n\nThe correct property order is as follows:\n\n- `onMutate`\n- `onError`\n- `onSettled`\n\nAll other properties are insensitive to the order as they do not depend on type inference.\n\n## Rule Details\n\nExamples of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/mutation-property-order\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useMutation } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nconst mutation = useMutation({\n  mutationFn: () => Promise.resolve('success'),\n  onSettled: () => {\n    results.push('onSettled-promise')\n    return Promise.resolve('also-ignored') // Promise<string> (should be ignored)\n  },\n  onMutate: async () => {\n    results.push('onMutate-async')\n    await sleep(1)\n    return { backup: 'async-data' }\n  },\n  onError: async () => {\n    results.push('onError-async-start')\n    await sleep(1)\n    results.push('onError-async-end')\n  },\n})\n```\n\nExamples of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/mutation-property-order\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useMutation } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nconst mutation = useMutation({\n  mutationFn: () => Promise.resolve('success'),\n  onMutate: async () => {\n    results.push('onMutate-async')\n    await sleep(1)\n    return { backup: 'async-data' }\n  },\n  onError: async () => {\n    results.push('onError-async-start')\n    await sleep(1)\n    results.push('onError-async-end')\n  },\n  onSettled: () => {\n    results.push('onSettled-promise')\n    return Promise.resolve('also-ignored') // Promise<string> (should be ignored)\n  },\n})\n```\n\n## Attributes\n\n- [x] ✅ Recommended\n- [x] 🔧 Fixable\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: mutation-property-order\ntitle: Ensure correct order of inference-sensitive properties in useMutation()\n---\n\nFor the following functions, the property order of the passed in object matters due to type inference:\n\n- `useMutation()`\n\nThe correct property order is as follows:\n\n- `onMutate`\n- `onError`\n- `onSettled`\n\nAll other properties are insensitive to the order as they do not depend on type inference.\n\n## Rule Details\n\nExamples of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/mutation-property-order\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useMutation } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nconst mutation = useMutation({\n  mutationFn: () => Promise.resolve('success'),\n  onSettled: () => {\n    results.push('onSettled-promise')\n    return Promise.resolve('also-ignored') // Promise<string> (should be ignored)\n  },\n  onMutate: async () => {\n    results.push('onMutate-async')\n    await sleep(1)\n    return { backup: 'async-data' }\n  },\n  onError: async () => {\n    results.push('onError-async-start')\n    await sleep(1)\n    results.push('onError-async-end')\n  },\n})\n```\n\nExamples of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/mutation-property-order\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useMutation } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nconst mutation = useMutation({\n  mutationFn: () => Promise.resolve('success'),\n  onMutate: async () => {\n    results.push('onMutate-async')\n    await sleep(1)\n    return { backup: 'async-data' }\n  },\n  onError: async () => {\n    results.push('onError-async-start')\n    await sleep(1)\n    results.push('onError-async-end')\n  },\n  onSettled: () => {\n    results.push('onSettled-promise')\n    return Promise.resolve('also-ignored') // Promise<string> (should be ignored)\n  },\n})\n```\n\n## Attributes\n\n- [x] ✅ Recommended\n- [x] 🔧 Fixable\n"}
